  ],
  "question": "After T6 (IE2 and the authority step), do the live claims at the address designated for locus A state every required proposition \u2014 [A-4] each job begins with one initial execution; [A-5] if the initial execution does not succeed, up to three retry executions of the job may be performed (at most four executions in total); [A-6] after the third retry ends without success no further execution of the job may start \u2014 with no two live claims stating the same meaning, and no live claim stating a meaning that contradicts them, belongs to another locus, or was never in the source? Optional descriptive statements may be present if faithful: A-o1, A-o2.",
